    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert technical resume writer. Rewrite the candidate's resume as a complete LaTeX (.tex) document tailored to the job below.\n\n**Job Title:** {{ $('Frontend input').item.json.body.jobTitle }}\n**Company Name:** {{ $('Frontend input').item.json.body.companyName }}\n**Job Description:**\n{{ $('Frontend input').item.json.body.jobDescription }}\n\n**Candidate's original resume (use only for facts, do not reuse phrasing):**\n{{ $('Extract data from pdf').item.json.text }}\n\n**Candidate's extracted personal details:**\nName: {{ $('Personal Details Extract').item.json.output.Name }}\nAddress: {{ $('Personal Details Extract').item.json.output.Address }}\nEmail: {{ $('Personal Details Extract').item.json.output.Email }}\nEducation: {{ JSON.stringify($('Personal Details Extract').item.json.output.Education) }}\n\n**Instructions:**\n- Use ONLY the LaTeX template below. Do not change the document structure, packages, or commands, only fill in and rewrite the placeholder content.\n- Escape LaTeX special characters (& % _ # $ {} ~ ^ \\) in any dynamic text you insert.\n- Tailor the Professional Summary, Skills, and Experience bullet points to the job title and description above, incorporating relevant keywords for ATS matching.\n- Do not add any commentary before or after the LaTeX document. Output must be valid, complete LaTeX source only, starting with \\documentclass and ending with \\end{document}.\n\n**Template:**\n\\documentclass[11pt,letterpaper]{article}\n\\usepackage[margin=0.75in]{geometry}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage{hyperref}\n\\pagestyle{empty}\n\n\\titleformat{\\section}{\\large\\bfseries}{}{0em}{}[\\titlerule]\n\\titlespacing{\\section}{0pt}{8pt}{4pt}\n\n\\begin{document}\n\n\\begin{center}\n{\\LARGE \\textbf{[Full Name]}} \\\\\n[Address] \\quad | \\quad [Email] \\quad | \\quad [Phone] \\quad | \\quad \\href{[LinkedIn URL]}{LinkedIn} \\quad | \\quad \\href{[GitHub URL]}{GitHub}\n\\end{center}\n\n\\section*{Professional Summary}\n[2-3 sentence summary tailored to the job]\n\n\\section*{Education}\n\\textbf{[Degree]} \\hfill [Year] \\\\\n[Institution], [Grade]\n\n\\section*{Experience}\n\\textbf{[Company Name]} -- [Job Title] \\hfill [Start] -- [End]\n\\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*,itemsep=2pt]\n  \\item [Bullet 1]\n  \\item [Bullet 2]\n  \\item [Bullet 3]\n\\end{itemize}\n\n\\section*{Skills}\n\\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*,itemsep=2pt]\n  \\item \\textbf{[Category]:} [skills]\n  \\item \\textbf{[Category]:} [skills]\n\\end{itemize}\n\n\\section*{Projects}\n\\textbf{[Project Title]}\n\\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*,itemsep=2pt]\n  \\item [Description with tools and results]\n\\end{itemize}\n\n\\end{document}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert technical resume writer who outputs only valid LaTeX source code."
        }
      },
